        <p>THE St. Helens Examiner and freicot Weekly News, _L published Friday afternoon. The district ecrnprises the centre of the Mass, Chemical, and Watch Trades of the King. dom. Atc. THE Runcorn Examiner, published Friday morn- ing. It is the only Weekly Paper in the district, and offers the best and cheapest facilities to advertisers. THE Widnes Examiner, published Friday morn- ing. Widnes contains the largest number of Chemical Works of any town in the kingdom, and is rapidly becoming an important centre of industry, Auction, Education, Wanted, To be Let, On Sale, Legal, Public Meeting, Sermon, Lecture, Bazaar, and other Public Notices, Advertise in etas (except Parliamentary) are Inserted in all the above papers at one charge. PREPAID ADVERTISEMENTS.</p>
